line":false},{"id":"cmt3hzyzu0veq2lpbj9hnwd82","gameId":"quest:60007101","markerType":"QUEST_EVENT","nameFr":"Un petit changement conséquent","nameEn":"A Small but Big Change","nameKo":"작고도 큰 변화","descriptionEn":"Water is spewing from the fountain in Dalmally. What's happening in this village that has turned into a desert? Ask someone standing near the fountain about the situation.","descriptionKo":"달말리 마을의 분수에서 물이 솟아나고 있었다. 사막이 되어버린 마을에 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는 것일까? 분수 근처에 서 있는 사람에게 상황을 물어보자.","lat":6299.8,"lng":5517.7,"region":"Dalmally Ruins","iconUrl":"/images/map-icons/i_quest_event.webp","slug":null,"slugFr":null,"slugKo":null,"linkType":null,"weaponGameId":null,"weaponGrade":null,"shopData":null,"fishingData":null,"mainZones":["CH04_Sector_Main_Desert2"],"subZones":["CH04_Sector_Sub_Dalmally_Ruins"],"zoneBorderline":false},{"id":"cmt3hzyzu0ver2lpb7afza882","gameId":"quest:60007105","markerType":"QUEST_EVENT","nameFr":"Tremblement de terre","nameEn":"Earthquake","nameKo":"땅울림","descriptionEn":"It's unclear whether the sudden spewing of water is a hopeful sign. Investigate what's going on in the desert.","descriptionKo":"갑자기 솟아난 물이 희망의 징조일지 알 수 없는 상황이다. 사막에 무슨 일이 벌어졌는지 확인해 보자.","lat":6475.4,"lng":5689.5,"region":"Dalmally Ruins","iconUrl":"/images/map-icons/i_quest_event.webp","slug":null,"slugFr":null,"slugKo":null,"linkType":null,"weaponGameId":null,"weaponGrade":null,"shopData":null,"fishingData":null,"mainZones":["CH04_Sector_Main_Desert2"],"subZones":["CH04_Sector_Sub_Dalmally_Ruins"],"zoneBorderline":false},{"id":"cmt3hzyzu0vel2lpbvptjrhq6","gameId":"quest:60001101","markerType":"QUEST_EVENT","nameFr":"Que le jeu commence !","nameEn":"Game Start!","nameKo":"게임 스타트!","descriptionEn":"Liones's east side is alive with excitement as a crowd gathers around a curious new stall. They say a unique surprise awaits anyone who participates. Let's get a closer look!","descriptionKo":"재미있어 보이는 이벤트 가판대를 구경하러 모인 사람들 때문에 여느 때보다 들떠 있는 리오네스의 동쪽 시가지.\n소문으로는 그 이벤트에 참여한 사람에게만 재미있는 일이 생긴다고 한다. 어떤 건지 한 번 알아 볼까?","lat":4217.7,"lng":4465.5,"region":"East District","iconUrl":"/images/map-icons/i_quest_event.webp","slug":null,"slugFr":null,"slugKo":null,"linkType":null,"weaponGameId":null,"weaponGrade":null,"shopData":null,"fishingData":null,"mainZones":["CH01_Sector_Main_Liones"],"subZones":["CH01_Sector_Sub_LionesCapital_East","Liones_Capital"],"zoneBorderline":false},{"id":"cmt3hzyzu0vem2lpbhknqpghh","gameId":"quest:60001110","markerType":"QUEST_EVENT","nameFr":"Le plaisir avant tout","nameEn":"Fun Is All That Matters","nameKo":"재미있으면 OK","descriptionEn":"Tristan was lured into a shady game of deathmatch by Jolly's mischievous prank. It's one thing to be tricked, but involving the 『Book of Stars』 is a step too far.","descriptionKo":"장난스러운 졸리에 함정에 빠져 그만 수상한 데스매치 게임에 참가하게 된 트리스탄.\n우연이었다지만, 『별의 서』까지 함께 휘말리고 말았다는 점은 그냥 넘어갈 수 없다.","lat":4214.3,"lng":4471.8,"region":"East District","iconUrl":"/images/map-icons/i_quest_event.webp","slug":null,"slugFr":null,"slugKo":null,"linkType":null,"weaponGameId":null,"weaponGrade":null,"shopData":null,"fishingData":null,"mainZones":["CH01_Sector_Main_Liones"],"subZones":["CH01_Sector_Sub_LionesCapital_East","Liones_Capital"],"zoneBorderline":false},{"id":"cmt3hzyzu0ven2lpbbg8tw2zd","gameId":"quest:60001145","markerType":"QUEST_EVENT","nameFr":"L'être le plus espiègle de Britannia","nameEn":"The Most Mischievous in All of Britannia","nameKo":"브리타니아에서 제일 짓궂은 녀석","descriptionEn":"Tristan is now quite familiar with Jolly's odd games. The time has finally come. Time for some real payback for all those pranks and lies.","descriptionKo":"졸리의 수상한 게임에 제법 익숙해진 트리스탄.\n이제 때가 됐다. 별 것 아닌 함정과 허풍으로 트리스탄을 농락해 온 졸리에게 본때를 보여주자.","lat":4212.9,"lng":4462,"region":"East District","iconUrl":"/images/map-icons/i_quest_event.webp","slug":null,"slugFr":null,"slugKo":null,"linkType":null,"weaponGameId":null,"weaponGrade":null,"shopData":null,"fishingData":null,"mainZones":["CH01_Sector_Main_Liones"],"subZones":["CH01_Sector_Sub_LionesCapital_Eas